---
import { Collapse, Spoiler } from 'astro-pure/user'
import PageLayout from '@/layouts/CommonPage.astro'
import Substats from '@/components/about/Substats.astro'

const headings = [
  { depth: 2, slug: 'hobbies', text: 'Hobbies' },
  { depth: 2, slug: 'social-networks', text: 'Social Networks' },
  { depth: 2, slug: 'gossips', text: 'Gossips' }
]
---

<PageLayout title='About' {headings} comment>
  <div class='about-summary'>
    <p>
      Hi, I’m Zhuze, a sophomore in the <strong>School of Electronics and Information</strong> at
      <strong>Northwestern Polytechnical University (NWPU)</strong>.
    </p>
    <p>
      My current research focuses on <strong>Embodied AI</strong>, with a particular emphasis on
      <strong>World Models</strong>. I am advised by <strong>Professor Dang Zheng</strong> in the
      <strong>PUPL Lab</strong> at NWPU.
    </p>
    <p>
      This site brings together my <strong>projects</strong>, <strong>paper notes</strong>,
      <strong>technical write-ups</strong>, and <strong>award records</strong>, alongside occasional writing
      beyond my main research interests.
    </p>
    <p class='about-motto'>
      Motto: Attention Is All You Need.
      <Spoiler>恭喜！你的CUDA失忆了！！！</Spoiler>
    </p>
  </div>

  {/* general-talk */}
  <h2 id='hobbies'>Hobbies</h2>
  <ul>
    <li> Tinkering with embedded systems and building DIY hardware projects. </li>
    <li> Anime fan into yuri, like Cosmic Princess Kaguya. </li>
    <li> Immersive single-player titles (Black Myth: Wukong, Hollow Knight), plus cooperative multiplayer (It Takes Two). </li>
  </ul>

  {/* social-networks */}
  <h2 id='social-networks'>Social Networks</h2>
  <p>
    Feel free to reach out or follow me on these platforms.
  </p>
  <Substats
    stats={[
      {
        platform: 'GitHub',
        icon: 'github',
        link: 'https://github.com/zz-unofficial',
        text: 'followers',
        api: 'github/zz-unofficial'
      },

      {
        platform: 'Bilibili',
        icon: 'bilibili',
        color: '#00aeec',
        link: 'https://space.bilibili.com/3546702879394547',
        text: 'fans',
        source: 'bilibili',
        uid: '3546702879394547',
        fallbackCount: 8
      },

      {
        platform: 'Steam',
        icon: 'steam',
        color: '#50769d',
        link: 'https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199721196125/',
        text: 'games',
        api: 'steamgames/76561199721196125'
      }
    ]}
  />

  {/* gossips */}
  <h2 id='gossips'>Gossips</h2>
  <Collapse title='Do not go gentle into that good night'>
    <blockquote>
      Do not go gentle into that good night,<br />
      Old age should burn and rave at close of day;<br />
      Rage, rage against the dying of the light.<br />
      <br />
      Though wise men at their end know dark is right,<br />
      Because their words had forked no lightning they<br />
      Do not go gentle into that good night.<br />
      <br />
      Good men, the last wave by, crying how bright<br />
      Their frail deeds might have danced in a green bay,<br />
      Rage, rage against the dying of the light.<br />
      <br />
      Wild men who caught and sang the sun in flight,<br />
      And learn, too late, they grieved it on its way,<br />
      Do not go gentle into that good night.<br />
      <br />
      Grave men, near death, who see with blinding sight<br />
      Blind eyes could blaze like meteors and be gay,<br />
      Rage, rage against the dying of the light.<br />
      <br />
      And you, my father, there on that sad height,<br />
      Curse, bless, me now with your fierce tears, I pray.<br />
      Do not go gentle into that good night.<br />
      Rage, rage against the dying of the light.
    </blockquote>
    <footer>— Dylan Thomas</footer>
  </Collapse>
</PageLayout>

<style>
  .about-summary {
    margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
  }

  .about-summary p {
    margin: 0;
    color: hsl(var(--foreground));
    font-size: 1rem;
    line-height: 1.8;
  }

  .about-summary p + p {
    margin-top: 1rem;
  }

  .about-summary strong {
    color: hsl(var(--primary));
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .about-summary .about-motto {
    margin-top: 1.4rem;
    color: hsl(var(--muted-foreground));
    font-size: 0.95rem;
  }
</style>
